# The full Lyapunov spectrum of the Lorenz system (new in XPPAUT 8.4, 21 Nov
# 2026): integrate, then Numerics -> stocHast -> Liapunov with its defaults.
# The exponents appear in a message box and in XPP's output.
keys i g                  # integrate: the exponents continue from the last point
keys u h l                # Numerics -> stocHast -> Liapunov
ok                        # its form: accept the values shown
keys esc                  # leave the Numerics menu
msg "Lyapunov exponents of Lorenz: about 0.9, 0, -14.6 (sum = -13.667)"
